ga4l(){return"Real damage counters come in three sizes \u2014 10, 50, and 100 \u2014 so these buttons use the same 10/50/100 denominations."},
gaa8(){return"This match timer is shared by both players. Starting, pausing, or resetting it from either side updates both displays."},
ga6p(){return"About this app"},
ga6o(){return"A tool for tracking and calculating a match played with real cards \u2014 it doesn't include the cards or rules themselves. In portrait orientation it's meant for two players sharing one device across a table; the top and bottom halves of the screen face each player's own direction. In landscape orientation, it is intended for managing only your side of the field."},
ga6r(){return"Card controls"},
ga6q(){return"Tap a card to open the damage dialog. Damage changes in 10/50/100 steps, matching the real 10/50/100-point damage counters, and you can reset only that card's damage from the dialog. Drag a card to swap it between the bench and the active spot (its marker follows the same Pok\xe9mon). The Ability label at the bottom of each card is a manual reminder for whether that Pok\xe9mon's ability has been used. Tap it to switch between unused and used. It isn't reset automatically, so toggle it whenever it fits your situation."},
ga6t(){return"Header buttons"},
ga6s(){return"Refresh icon: after confirmation, resets that player's progress \u2014 damage, Special Conditions, Ability usage, Lost Zone, turn actions, and the GX/VSTAR marker's used flag (display and theme settings are not reset).\nCoin Toss: flips a coin.\nMenu (\u22ee): Battle Display changes bench slots and markers. Bench slots apply only to the current battle, while marker selections carry over to the next one. End Battle returns to Home after confirmation."},
ga6x(){return"Special conditions"},
ga6w(){return"Track Poison, Burn, Sleep, Paralysis, and Confusion. Sleep, Paralysis, and Confusion can only be active one at a time \u2014 choosing a new one clears the previous automatically. Poison and Burn can be combined with any of them."},
ga3d(){return"Pok\xe9mon Checkup"},
